{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19173","headline":"和杨师臯给事伤小姬英英 · 刘禹锡","name":"和杨师臯给事伤小姬英英","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见学胡琴见艺成，今朝追想几伤情。\n捻弦花下呈新曲，放拨灯前谢改名。\n但是好花皆易落，从来尤物不长生。\n鸾台夜直衣衾冷，云雨无因入禁城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}